<h2>Tabs</h2>
<p>Show one panel at a time from a set of tab buttons, with full ARIA tablist support and arrow-key navigation.</p>

<div class="demo-box" data-controller="tabs">
  <div role="tablist" aria-label="Account settings">
    <button type="button" data-tabs-target="tab" data-action="click->tabs#select keydown->tabs#keydown">
      Profile
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-tabs-target="tab" data-action="click->tabs#select keydown->tabs#keydown">
      Notifications
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-tabs-target="tab" data-action="click->tabs#select keydown->tabs#keydown">
      Billing
    </button>
  </div>

  <div data-tabs-target="panel">
    <p>Update your name, email, and avatar.</p>
    <label for="display-name">Display name</label>
    <input id="display-name" type="text" value="Craig McNaughton" />
  </div>
  <div data-tabs-target="panel">
    <p>Choose what you get notified about.</p>
    <label><input type="checkbox" checked> Email me about new replies</label>
    <br>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Email me about product updates</label>
  </div>
  <div data-tabs-target="panel">
    <p>Manage your plan and payment method.</p>
    <p>Current plan: <strong>Pro</strong> &mdash; $12/month</p>
    <button type="button">Update payment method</button>
  </div>
</div>

<h3>Starting on a specific tab</h3>
<p>Set <code>data-tabs-index-value</code> to open on a tab other than the first:</p>
<div class="demo-box" data-controller="tabs" data-tabs-index-value="2">
  <div role="tablist" aria-label="Starts on third tab">
    <button type="button" data-tabs-target="tab" data-action="click->tabs#select keydown->tabs#keydown">
      Overview
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-tabs-target="tab" data-action="click->tabs#select keydown->tabs#keydown">
      Activity
    </button>
    <button type="button" data-tabs-target="tab" data-action="click->tabs#select keydown->tabs#keydown">
      Settings
    </button>
  </div>

  <div data-tabs-target="panel">
    <p>Overview content.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-tabs-target="panel">
    <p>Activity content.</p>
  </div>
  <div data-tabs-target="panel">
    <p>This panel (Settings) is open by default because the controller starts at index 2.</p>
  </div>
</div>
